{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248580/extras/e5360d03706d6e2d0a4367b9a7363b04.avif?t=1755276005\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Neo Gunma, the mega fast-food corporation, Wank Wanknald, has gained a stranglehold on the city and its people by driving out all other available competition. Inspector Jenny is on a murder case when she enlists the help of the private detective Suzuka to aid in her investigation, but things quickly take a turn for the worse when riots break out across the city due to a change in their menu, leaving many of the poorer citizens of the city unable to afford anything to eat anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248580/extras/49fe09d3922193eb307222c9e6749031.avif?t=1755276005\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city to gather information, items, and supplies as you work your way up to the top and take down the corporation oppressing the city. You\u2019ll need to be careful as you traverse the seedy underside of Neo Gunma. It\u2019s not just the corporation\u2019s goons that you\u2019ll have to keep an eye out for! Neo Gunma is home to all sorts of lecherous fiends eyeing out Suzuka\u2019s killer body, just waiting for the opportunity to spend some time with her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in classic turn-based RPG combat where you\u2019ll need to not only bring brute force to the table, but prepare in advance and adapt on the fly if you hope to come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248580/extras/2a09da28892437742